        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n!theme plain\nleft to right direction\n\nactor \&quot;Reader\&quot; as Reader\nactor \&quot;Librarian\&quot; as Lib\nactor \&quot;Administrator\&quot; as Admin\n\n&#39; Hierarchy: Lib and Admin inherit Reader features\nReader &lt;|-- Lib\nReader &lt;|-- Admin\n\nrectangle \&quot;Library Network System\&quot; {\n    \n    &#39; Reader Cases\n    usecase \&quot;Register\&quot; as UC_Reg\n    usecase \&quot;Search Books\&quot; as UC_Search\n    usecase \&quot;View Details\&quot; as UC_View\n    usecase \&quot;Book Item\&quot; as UC_Book\n    usecase \&quot;Cancel Booking\&quot; as UC_Cancel\n    usecase \&quot;View History\&quot; as UC_Hist\n\n    &#39; Librarian Cases\n    usecase \&quot;Manage Books\\n(Add/Remove)\&quot; as UC_ManageBooks\n    usecase \&quot;Issue/Return Book\&quot; as UC_Issue\n    usecase \&quot;Manage Catalog\&quot; as UC_Catalog\n    usecase \&quot;View Active Bookings\&quot; as UC_Active\n\n    &#39; Admin Cases\n    usecase \&quot;Manage Branches\&quot; as UC_Branch\n    usecase \&quot;Manage Accounts\&quot; as UC_Users\n    usecase \&quot;View Analytics\&quot; as UC_Analytics\n\n    &#39; Relationships\n    Reader --&gt; UC_Reg\n    Reader --&gt; UC_Search\n    Reader --&gt; UC_Book\n    Reader --&gt; UC_Cancel\n    Reader --&gt; UC_Hist\n\n    Lib --&gt; UC_ManageBooks\n    Lib --&gt; UC_Issue\n    Lib --&gt; UC_Catalog\n    Lib --&gt; UC_Active\n\n    Admin --&gt; UC_Branch\n    Admin --&gt; UC_Users\n    Admin --&gt; UC_Analytics\n\n    &#39; Includes/Extends\n    UC_Book ..&gt; UC_Search : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n    UC_Search &lt;.. UC_View : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n}\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="YRxuyyYZTaZ4O-DWkpGm-1">
